  "summary": "A common resident. Yellow below, with an orange breast and a white belly and vent. The head is black with white streaks, including a white stripe below the eye, and the mantle is brown with a white shoulder-patch. The female has yellowish head-streaks, and the immature has brown ones. The call is pret-ty-boyeee, sometimes answered sitee. The song is a repeated chipchipchipchipchip-teee, teeu-teeu-teeu-teeu. The Kemp code RB was left unchanged.",
